            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiigoito lagokab luulenik, che kiweeksei eng’ ole kigiluulji, kagochinoik che kibeelei, kogochi Kamuktaindetab Israel, kirugik taman ak aeng’ agobo Israel tugul, mengichik tamanwogik sogol ak lo, arekab kechir tamanwogik tisab ak tisab, kwesik taman ak aeng’, koek kagochinetab tengekto: kiek chuto tugul kagochinet ne kibeeljin Jehovah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 8:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak kiigochi ng’atutikab laitoriat kandoikab laitoriat ak bounik che mi ainet bitonin: ak kitoret bik ak gotab Kamuktaindet.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.8.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.8.36"
            ]
          }
